      "id": "build-config",
      "intro": "Konfigurasi Build memungkinkan Anda mengatur parameter build rule — mapping data, environment variables, dan dependency rule.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Apa Itu Build Config?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Data Mapping** — Petakan field data ke variabel node\n• **Environment** — Pilih Dev / Staging / Production\n• **Rule Dependencies** — Rule lain yang harus jalan dulu\n• **Timeout** — Batas waktu eksekusi (default: 30 detik)",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;padding:14px 16px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#eef2ff;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#4338ca;\">🗺️ Data Mapping</div><div style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#eef2ff;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#4338ca;\">🌐 Environment</div><div style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#eef2ff;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#4338ca;\">🔗 Rule Dependencies</div><div style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#eef2ff;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#4338ca;\">⏱️ Timeout (30 detik)</div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Cara Konfigurasi",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Buka tab **Build Configuration** saat mengedit rule\n• Atur Data Mapping (biasanya otomatis)\n• Pilih Environment dan atur Dependencies\n• Atur Timeout dan Error Handling\n• Klik **Save** untuk menyimpan",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:6px;background:#ede9fe;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#7c3aed;\">🖥️ Development</span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:6px;background:#ede9fe;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#7c3aed;\">🚀 Production</span></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Tips Build Config",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• 🧪 Test di Development dulu sebelum Production\n• 🔗 Atur Dependencies untuk rule yang berurutan\n• ⏱️ Naikkan Timeout untuk rule kompleks\n• 🛑 Pilih Stop on Error untuk rule kritis",
